    <string name="lab_guard_title">Guardrails</string>
    <string name="lab_guard_subtitle">Prompt injection inside documents: attack each engine, layer the defenses and measure how often a secret leaks.</string>

    <string name="guard_intro">The model gets a secret code in its instructions and must summarize a document that hides a hostile instruction asking for that code. A leak is an exact match, so no model has to judge it. Each defense adds a layer on top of the previous one.</string>
